---
/*
  #collect — the four modality cards.

  The data-types hub link and the Nigerian English link are out until those
  pages are ported; African speech data stands in for Nigerian English on the
  speech card.
*/
---

<section id="collect" class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">What we collect</div>
  <h2>Four data types, one compliance standard.</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Most of our work is commissioned: you define the specification, we build the dataset.
    Everything below is collected from consenting human contributors — never scraped, never
    AI-generated.
  </p>

  <div class="mod-grid">
    <div class="mod">
      <span class="tag t-live">Available for evaluation</span>
      <h3>Speech &amp; Voice</h3>
      <p>Our deepest capability, with samples ready to evaluate today.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Conversational and scripted speech</li>
        <li>Voice-over and TTS studio corpora</li>
        <li>Multi-speaker dialogue</li>
        <li>Spontaneous &amp; code-switched speech</li>
        <li>Domain-specific: health, finance, legal, customer service</li>
      </ul>
      <nav class="mod-rows" aria-label="Speech data pages">
        <a class="mod-row" href="/african-speech-data">African speech data<span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg></span></a>
        <a class="mod-row" href="/yoruba-speech-data">Yorùbá speech data<span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg></span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="mod">
      <span class="tag t-comm">On commission</span>
      <h3>Image Data</h3>
      <p>Collected to your spec through our contributor networks across Nigeria.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Everyday objects and environments</li>
        <li>Documents, signage and handwriting</li>
        <li>Food, markets and commerce scenes</li>
        <li>Consented human subjects</li>
        <li>Device, angle and lighting variation to brief</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mod">
      <span class="tag t-comm">On commission</span>
      <h3>Video Data</h3>
      <p>Scenario-based video capture with full contributor rights clearance.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Human activities and gestures</li>
        <li>Daily life and household routines</li>
        <li>On-screen speakers and presentations</li>
        <li>Multi-angle and device-varied capture</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mod">
      <span class="tag t-live">Available for evaluation</span>
      <h3>Text &amp; Language Data</h3>
      <p>Written and transcribed language resources for low-resource NLP.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Parallel and bilingual corpora</li>
        <li>Verbatim, time-aligned transcripts</li>
        <li>Prompt–response and instruction data</li>
        <li>Tonally accurate Yorùbá, Unicode NFC-normalised</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Speech card only: link rows pinned to the card foot */
  .mod-rows { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column }
  .mod-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--green-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: .94rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .mod-row:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line) }
  .mod-row:hover { color: var(--green) }
  .chev {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mist);
    color: var(--green);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .mod-row:hover .chev, .mod-row:focus-visible .chev { background: var(--green); color: #fff }

  .mod-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: var(--card-gap) }
  .mod { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column }
  .mod .tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .t-live { background: var(--mist); color: var(--green-deep); border: 1px solid var(--green) }
  .t-comm { background: #FBF3E3; color: #7A5310; border: 1px solid var(--amber) }
  .mod p { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--slate) }
  .mod ul { margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 18px; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--slate) }
  .mod li { margin-bottom: 3px }
</style>
